ukan peninjauan berkas secara serentak pada jam puncak asesmen.</p><div class="wrap-tags arch__tags"><span class="tag">Golang (Echo)</span><span class="tag">Redis Cache</span><span class="tag">PostgreSQL</span><span class="tag">Docker &amp; Nginx</span></div><div class="arch__stats"><div class="stat arch-metric"><span class="stat__label">Participants</span><span class="stat__num">450+</span><span class="mono arch-metric__unit">Across 12 TUK</span></div><div class="stat arch-metric"><span class="stat__label">Active Assessor</span><span class="stat__num">50+</span><span class="mono arch-metric__unit">Simultaneous Review</span></div><div class="stat arch-metric"><span class="stat__label">Certificates</span><span class="stat__num">130+</span><span class="mono arch-metric__unit">Official Issued</span></div><div class="stat arch-metric"><span class="stat__label">DevOps Support</span><span class="stat__num">Solo</span><span class="mono arch-metric__unit">Docker + Nginx di VPS</span></div></div></article><article class="arch__pipeline"><div class="cell__head"><span class="mono mono--ink arch__flow-label"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="13" width="13" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"></polyline></svg>Pipeline execution flow</span><span class="chip"><span class="chip__dot chip__dot--live" aria-hidden="true"></span>Alur sistem</span></div><div class="arch-step"><span class="arch-step__num">1</span><div class="arch-step__body"><h4 class="arch-step__title">Echo HTTP Server</h4><span class="tag">Golang + Echo</span><p class="arch-step__desc">Satu goroutine ringan per request untuk melayani akses serentak asesor dan admin.</p></div></div><div class="arch-step"><span class="arch-step__num">2</span><div class="arch-step__body"><h4 class="arch-step__title">RESTful API Design</h4><span class="tag">Kontrak API</span><p class="arch-step__desc">Endpoint sertifikasi, jadwal uji, dan verifikasi berkas dengan skema response konsisten.</p></div></div><div class="arch-step"><span class="arch-step__num">3</span><div class="arch-step__body"><h4 class="arch-step__title">In-Memory Cache</h4><span class="tag">Redis</span><p class="arch-step__desc">Menekan pembacaan berat ke database utama saat sesi asesmen puncak.</p></div></div><div class="arch-step"><span class="arch-step__num">4</span><div class="arch-step__body"><h4 class="arch-step__title">Relational Persistence</h4><span class="tag">PostgreSQL</span><p class="arch-step__desc">Skema data asesi, asesor, skema sertifikasi, dan sertifikat ternormalisasi.</p></div></div><div class="arch-step"><span class="arch-step__num">5</span><div class="arch-step__body"><h4 class="arch-step__title">Container &amp; Reverse Proxy</h4><span class="tag">Docker + Nginx</span><p class="arch-step__desc">Deployment dan maintenance mandiri di VPS tanpa tim DevOps khusus.</p></div></div></article><article class="term arch__term"><div class="term__bar"><span class="term__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="term__dot term__dot--acid" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="term__dot term__dot--moss" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="arch__file">assessment_handler.go</span><button type="button" class="arch__copy" title="Salin kode arsitektur" aria-label="Salin cuplikan kode arsitektur"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="12" width="12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg><span>Copy</span></button><span class="tag arch__lang">go</span></div><div class="term__body"><pre><code><span class="tok-com">// CoachPro Assessment Concurrency Handler</span>
<span class="tok-key">package</span> handler

<span class="tok-key">import</span> (
    <span class="tok-str">&quot;context&quot;</span>
    <span class="tok-str">&quot;net/http&quot;</span>
    <span class="tok-str">&quot;time&quot;</span>

    <span class="tok-str">&quot;github.com/labstack/echo/v4&quot;</span>
)

<span class="tok-key">func</span> (h *AssessmentHandler) <span class="tok-fn">SubmitAssessment</span>(c echo.Context) error {
    ctx, cancel := context.<span class="tok-fn">WithTimeout</span>(c.<span class="tok-fn">Request</span>().<span class="tok-fn">Context</span>(), 3*time.Second)
    <span class="tok-key">defer</span> <span class="tok-fn">cancel</span>()

    <span class="tok-key">var</span> req AssessmentPayload
    <span class="tok-key">if</span> err := c.<span class="tok-fn">Bind</span>(&amp;req); err != nil {
        <span class="tok-key">return</span> c.<span class="tok-fn">JSON</span>(http.StatusBadRequest, echo.Map{<span class="tok-str">&quot;error&quot;</span>: <span class="tok-str">&quot;Invalid payload&quot;</span>})
    }

    <span class="tok-com">// Concurrent cache invalidation + database commit</span>
    errChan := <span class="tok-fn">make</span>(chan error, 1)
    <span class="tok-key">go</span> <span class="tok-key">func</span>() {
        errChan &lt;- h.service.<span class="tok-fn">ProcessSubmission</span>(ctx, &amp;req)
    }()

    <span class="tok-key">select</span> {
    <span class="tok-key">case</span> err := &lt;-errChan:
        <span class="tok-key">if</span> err != nil { <span class="tok-key">return</span> c.<span class="tok-fn">JSON</span>(http.StatusInternalServerError, err.<span class="tok-fn">Error</span>()) }
        <span class="tok-key">return</span> c.<span class="tok-fn">JSON</span>(http.StatusOK, echo.Map{<span class="tok-str">&quot;status&quot;</span>: <span class="tok-str">&quot;CONFIRMED&quot;</span>})
    <span class="tok-key">case</span> &lt;-ctx.<span class="tok-fn">Done</span>():
        <span class="tok-key">return</span> c.<span class="tok-fn">JSON</span>(http.StatusGatewayTimeout, echo.Map{<span class="tok-str">&quot;error&quot;</span>: <span class="tok-str">&quot;Execution timeout&quot;</span>})
    }
}</code></pre></div></article></div></div></div></section><section id="projects" class="band-bleed"><div class="sheet"><div><header class="section__head"><div class="reveal  section__lead" style="--d:0ms"><span class="section__num">03</span><h2 class="section__title">Proyek pilihan &amp; rekayasa sistem</h2></div><div class="section__aside"><p class="section__sub">Kumpulan sistem yang saya bangun sendiri dari nol: backend konkurensi Golang + Redis, antarmuka React &amp; Vue.js, sistem internal Laravel, hingga model machine learning yang diuji pada data nyata.</p><span class="section__meta">Portofolio // Selected works</span><div class="panel panel--pad-sm panel--plate col proj-toolbar"><div class="row row--tight proj-toolbar__row" role="tablist" aria-label="Mode Tampilan Portofolio"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="chip proj-filter chip--ink"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="12" width="12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline></svg>Semua terbuka</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="chip proj-filter"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="12" width="12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"></rect><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"></rect><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"></rect><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"></rect></svg>Bento grid</button></div><hr class="rule"/><div class="row row--tight proj-toolbar__row" role="tablist" aria-label="Filter Kategori Portofolio"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="chip proj-filter chip--ink"><span>SEMUA PROYEK</span><span class="proj-filter__count"><span>0</span></span></button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="chip proj-filter"><span>WEB &amp; ENTERPRISE</span><span class="proj-filter__count"><span>0</span></span></button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="chip proj-filter"><span>AI &amp; MACHINE LEARNING</span><span class="proj-filter__count"><span>0</span></span></button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="chip proj-filter"><span>DATA SCIENCE</span><span class="proj-filter__count"><span>0</span></span></button></div></div></div></header></div><div class="pslab-list"><div class="reveal  pslab-row" style="--d:0ms"><article class="pslab pslab--lead" data-hue="cobalt"><header class="pslab__band"><span class="pslab__num" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div class="pslab__band-id"><span class="mono pslab__kind">Web Platform</span><h3 class="pslab__title"><span class="hl">CoachPro Certification Management System</span></h3></div><span class="pslab__stamp">Produksi<!-- --> / <!-- -->2025 – 2026</span></header><div class="pslab__media"><img alt="Tampilan CoachPro Certification Management System" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/images/coachpro/ss_01_landing_hero.png"/><span class="pslab__sticker">⚡ LIVE PRODUCTION</span></div><div class="pslab__cols"><div class="pslab__body"><p class="pslab__sub">Platform Manajemen Sertifikasi Nasional — LSP CoachPro Indonesia (Maganghub Kemnaker)</p><p class="pslab__lede">Platform sertifikasi kompetensi nasional yang dibangun solo end-to-end — melayani 450+ peserta (asesi) dan 50+ asesor di 12 tempat uji kompetensi (TUK) dengan 130+ sertifikat terbit.</p><p class="pslab__long">Bertanggung jawab penuh merancang, membangun, dan men-deploy platform manajemen sertifikasi profesional dari awal (from scratch) untuk program Maganghub Kementerian Ketenagakerjaan RI. Sistem mendigitalkan seluruh alur asesmen nasional: mencakup 50+ jadwal aktif, 50+ asesor berlisensi, 450+ asesi terdaftar di 12 Tempat Uji Kompetensi (TUK), serta memproses 450+ evaluasi kompetensi hingga menerbitkan 130+ sertifikat resmi. Backend dibangun menggunakan Golang (Echo) dan PostgreSQL dengan Redis caching layer untuk menangani konkurensi 50+ asesor serentak tanpa latensi, dideploy mandiri di VPS menggunakan Docker dan Nginx.</p><div class="wrap-tags pslab__tags"><span class="tag proj-tag--sky">Golang (Echo)</span><span class="tag proj-tag--moss">Vue.js</span><span class="tag proj-tag--clay">Tailwind CSS</span><span class="tag proj-tag--sky">PostgreSQL</span><span class="tag proj-tag--sky">Redis</span><span class="tag proj-tag--sky">Docker</span><span class="tag proj-tag--sky">Nginx</span><span class="tag proj-tag--stone">VPS</span></div><div class="row row--tight pslab__cta"><a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" href="https://sertifikasi.coachpro.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kunjungi situs<svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="btn__icon" height="13" width="13" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg></a><a class="btn btn--sm" href="https://github.com/ErgaWanda" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="btn__icon" height="13" width="13" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"></path></s