onsif yang memangkas waktu review berkas asesmen bagi admin dan asesor</span></li></ul></aside></div><div class="pslab__shots"><span class="mono pslab__shots-label"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" height="12" width="12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>6<!-- --> halaman</span><div class="pslab__shots-track"><button type="button" class="pslab__shot" title="Landing Page — Hero &amp; Statistik Platform (450+ Asesi, 50+ Asesor, 12 TUK, 130+ Sertifikat Terbit)" aria-label="Landing Page — Hero &amp; Statistik Platform (450+ Asesi, 50+ Asesor, 12 TUK, 130+ Sertifikat Terbit)"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="288" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/images/coachpro/ss_01_landing_hero.png"/><span class="pslab__shot-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span></button><button type="button" class="pslab__shot" title="Halaman Login — Autentikasi Pengguna &amp; Asesor berbasis NIK aman" aria-label="Halaman Login — Autentikasi Pengguna &amp; Asesor berbasis NIK aman"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="288" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/images/coachpro/ss_02_login.png"/><span class="pslab__shot-num" aria-hidden="true">02</span></button><button type="button" class="pslab__shot" title="Dashboard Admin — Monitoring Real-time: 50+ Jadwal, 50+ Asesor, Evaluasi Kompetensi &amp; Hasil Uji" aria-label="Dashboard Admin — Monitoring Real-time: 50+ Jadwal, 50+ Asesor, Evaluasi Kompetensi &amp; Hasil Uji"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="288" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/images/coachpro/ss_03_dashboard_admin.png"/><span class="pslab__shot-num" aria-hidden="true">03</span></button><button type="button" class="pslab__shot" title="Analytics — Tren Pendaftaran 