y/ss_01_hero.png"/><span class="pslab__sticker">🌐 LIVE PRODUCTION</span></div><div class="pslab__cols"><div class="pslab__body"><p class="pslab__sub">Website Profil Perusahaan Logistik Global — logskygroup.com</p><p class="pslab__lede">Website profil perusahaan komersial LogSkyGroup yang dibangun mandiri end-to-end menggunakan React dengan arsitektur modular dan token-based CSS design system.</p><p class="pslab__long">Website profil perusahaan logistik internasional LogSkyGroup yang dikembangkan secara solo dari tahap desain, arsitektur, hingga live deployment di logskygroup.com. Dibangun menggunakan React (Vite) dengan pendekatan arsitektur modular (custom hooks, komponen reusable, data layers terpisah) serta mengimplementasikan token-based CSS design system (tokens.css, globals.css) untuk konsistensi tampilan dan kemudahan maintainability.</p><div class="wrap-tags pslab__tags"><span class="tag proj-tag--moss">React (Vite)</span><span class="tag proj-tag--stone">Custom CSS</span><span class="tag proj-tag--stone">Design Tokens</span></div><div class="row row--tight pslab__cta"><a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" href="https://logskygroup.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kunjungi situs<svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="btn__icon" height="13" width="13" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg></a><a class="btn btn--sm" href="https://github.com/ErgaWanda" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="btn__icon" height="13" width="13" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.