an></li><li><span class="pslab__highs-num">04</span><span>Dashboard visualisasi interaktif Vue.js menyajikan tren sentimen real-time dan word cloud</span></li><li><span class="pslab__highs-num">05</span><span>Evaluasi performa model komprehensif menggunakan Confusion Matrix dan metrik akurasi</span></li></ul></aside></div><div class="pslab__shots"><span class="mono pslab__shots-label"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" height="12" width="12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>6<!-- --> halaman</span><div class="pslab__shots-track"><button type="button" class="pslab__shot" title="Halaman Login — Autentikasi Pengguna Portal Analisis Sentimen UNSADA" aria-label="Halaman Login — Autentikasi Pengguna Portal Analisis Sentimen UNSADA"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="288" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/images/unsada_sentiment/image17.png"/><span class="pslab__shot-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span></button><button type="button" class="pslab__shot" title="Form Pendaftaran Akun — Registrasi Pengguna untuk Akses Dashboard Analisis" aria-label="Form Pendaftaran Akun — Registrasi Pengguna untuk Akses Dashboard Analisis"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="288" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/images/unsada_sentiment/image18.png"/><span class="pslab__shot-num" aria-hidden="true">02</span></button><button type="button" class="pslab__shot" title="Beranda Utama — Tampilan Dashboard Interaktif dengan Panduan Alur Analisis Teks" aria-label="Beranda Utama — Tampilan Dashboard Interaktif dengan Panduan Alur Analisis Teks"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="288" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/images/unsada_sentiment/image19.png"/><span class="pslab_