-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/images/bert_sentiment/image25.jpeg"/><span class="pslab__sticker">🧠 BERT NLP</span></div><div class="pslab__cols"><div class="pslab__body"><p class="pslab__sub">Riset NLP Berbasis Deep Learning Transformer — Model BERT</p><p class="pslab__lede">Fine-tuning model NLP BERT (Transformers) untuk menganalisis sentimen dan persepsi publik terhadap kebijakan pembelian BBM antara Shell dan Pertamina.</p><p class="pslab__long">Riset pemrosesan bahasa alami (NLP) tingkat lanjut yang melakukan fine-tuning pada model BERT (Bidirectional Encoder Representations from Transformers). Riset ini menganalisis sentimen masyarakat secara mendalam terhadap dinamika kebijakan pembelian bahan bakar minyak Shell vs Pertamina, menangkap nuansa kontekstual dan sentimen tersirat yang tidak dapat dideteksi oleh metode klasifikasi sederhana.</p><div class="wrap-tags pslab__tags"><span class="tag proj-tag--clay">Python</span><span class="tag proj-tag--clay">BERT</span><span class="tag proj-tag--stone">Transformers</span><span class="tag proj-tag--clay">NLP</span></div><div class="row row--tight pslab__cta"><a class="btn btn--sm" href="https://github.com/ErgaWanda" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="btn__icon" height="13" width="13" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"></path></svg>Kode sumber</a><button type="button" class="btn btn--ink btn--sm"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="btn__icon" height="13" width="13" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>Buka detail</button></div></div><aside class="pslab__aside"><span class="mono pslab__aside-label"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" height="12" width="12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><line x1="8" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"></line><line x1="8" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"></line><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="3.01" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="3.01" y2="12"></line><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="3.01" y2="18"></line></svg>Yang dikerjakan</span><ul class="pslab__highs"><li><span class="pslab__highs-num">01</span><span>Fine-tuning model transformer BERT untuk menangkap semantik dan konteks kalimat Bahasa Indonesia</span></li><li><span class="pslab__highs-num">02</span><span>Analisis komparatif opini publik terhadap kebijakan dua entitas energi utama (Shell vs Pertamina)</span></li><li><span class="pslab__highs-num">03</span><span>Pipeline inferensi teks dengan representasi embedding kontekstual</span></li><li><span class="pslab__highs-num">04</span><span>Menangkap nuansa konteks dan sentimen tersirat yang lolos dari metode klasifikasi sederhana</span></li></ul></aside></div><div class="pslab__shots"><span class="mono pslab__shots-label"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" height="12" width="12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>6<!-- --> halaman</span><div class="pslab__shots-track"><button type="button" class="pslab__shot" title="Portal Login — SentimenPro AI Text Classifier" aria-label="Portal Login — SentimenPro AI Text C