ebutuhan</h3></div><span class="workflow__glyph" style="--wf-accent:var(--tint-sand)"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polygon points="16.24 7.76 14.12 14.12 7.76 16.24 9.88 9.88 16.24 7.76"></polygon></svg></span></div><p class="workflow__desc">Memahami tujuan bisnis, dekonstruksi spesifikasi sistem, dan kalkulasi beban data sebelum mulai coding.</p><div class="workflow__deliver"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="14" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg><span class="mono mono--ink">PRD &amp; Analisis Kebutuhan</span></div></div></article><article class="reveal  workflow__step" style="--d:90ms"><span class="mono mono--ink workflow__num">02</span><div class="workflow__body"><div class="workflow__head"><div class="workflow__titles"><span class="chip">SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE</span><h3 class="display-m workflow__title">Desain Arsitektur</h3></div><span class="workflow__glyph" style="--wf-accent:var(--tint-sky)"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"></polygon><polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"></polyline><polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"></polyline></svg></span></div><p class="workflow__desc">Merancang skema database relasional, kontrak RESTful API, dan arsitektur MVC yang terstruktur sebelum tulis kode.</p><div class="workflow__deliver"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="14" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg><span class="mono mono--ink">ERD &amp; Kontrak API</span></div></div></article><article class="reveal  workflow__step" style="--d:180ms"><span class="mono mono--ink workflow__num">03</span><div class="workflow__body"><div class="workflow__head"><div class="workflow__titles"><span class="chip">UI/UX &amp; PROTOTYPING</span><h3 class="display-m workflow__title">Desain Antarmuka</h3></div><span class="workflow__glyph" style="--wf-accent:var(--tint-clay)"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"></rect><line x1="9" y1="1" x2="9" y2="4"></line><line x1="15" y1="1" x2="15" y2="4"></line><line x1="9" y1="20" x2="9" y2="23"></line><line x1="15" y1="20" x2="15" y2="23"></line><line x1="20" y1="9" x2="23" y2="9"></line><line x1="20" y1="14" x2="23" y2="14"></line><line x1="1" y1="9" x2="4" y2="9"></line><line x1="1" y1="14" x2="4" y2="14"></line></svg></span></div><p class="workflow__desc">Mendesain antarmuka responsif dengan umpan balik interaktif yang konsisten di perangkat mobile maupun desktop.</p><div class="workflow__deliver"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="14" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg><span class="mono mono--ink">Komponen Reaktif &amp; UI Flow</span></div></div></article><article class="reveal  workflow__step" style="--d:270ms"><span class="mono mono--ink workflow__num">04</span><div class="workflow__body"><div class="workflow__head"><div class="workflow__titles"><span class="chip">CLEAN CODE &amp; TESTING</span><h3 class="display-m workflow__title">Implementasi Kode</h3></div><span class="workflow__glyph" style="--wf-accent:var(--tint-moss)"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline></svg></span></div><p class="workflow__desc">Eksekusi backend Golang (Echo) dan Laravel bersama caching Redis, RESTful API, serta struktur kode yang rapi.</p><div class="workflow__deliver"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="14" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg><span class="mono mono--ink">Clean Architecture &amp; Unit Tests</span></div></div></article><article class="reveal  workflow__step" style="--d:360ms"><span class="mono mono--ink workflow__num">05</span><div class="workflow__body"><div class="workflow__head"><div class="workflow__titles"><span class="chip">DEPLOYMENT &amp; UPTIME</span><h3 class="display-m workflow__title">Pengujian &amp; Rilis</h3></div><span class="workflow__glyph" style="--wf-accent:var(--tint-stone)"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><line x1="22" y1="2" x2="11" y2="13"></line><polygon points="22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2"></polygon></svg></span></div><p class="workflow__desc">Deployment containerized dengan Docker dan reverse proxy Nginx di VPS, dipelihara mandiri untuk menjaga stabilitas produksi.</p><div class="workflow__deliver"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="14" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg><span class="mono mono--ink">Dockerized &amp; Live Production</span></div></div></article></div><div class="reveal  workflow__creed panel panel--plate panel--sand" style="--d:120ms"><span class="workflow__quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">”</span><div class="workflow__creed-text"><span class="chip">Prinsip &amp; filosofi rekayasa sistem</span><p class="lede workflow__quote">“Kode yang baik bukan sekadar berjalan tanpa error, melainkan arsitektur yang dirancang untuk skalabilitas tinggi, efisiensi konkurensi, dan keandalan sistem jangka panjang.”</p></div><div class="workflow__author"><span class="chip__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="col"><span class="workflow__author-name">Erga Wanda Afriza</span><span class="mono">IT Developer — RDS Group</span></div></div></div></div></section><section id="contact" data-hue="cobalt" class="band-bleed contact"><div class="sheet"><header class="section__head"><div class="reveal  section__lead" style="--d:0ms"><span class="section__num">08</span><h2 class="section__title">“Let&#x27;s build robust &amp; scalable systems together.”           </h2></div><div class="section__aside"><p class="section__sub">Jalur komunikasi langsung dengan Erga. Terbuka untuk pengembangan backend Golang &amp; Laravel, antarmuka reaktif React &amp; Vue.js, atau proyek machine learning yang dioperasikan sampai produksi.</p><span class="section__meta">Direct inquiries</span></div></header><div class="contact__grid"><article class="reveal  panel contact__form" style="--d:60ms"><div class="cell__head"><h3 class="display-m">Kirim pesan langsung</h3><span class="chip">Hubungi saya</span></div><p class="contact__lede">Pesan akan otomatis terkirim langsung ke email pribadi saya dan segera saya respons.</p><form class="contact__form-body"><div class="contact__fields"><div class="field"><label class="field__label" for="cs-name">Nama lengkap *</label><input id="cs-name" class="field__input" type="text" required="" placeholder="e.g. Alex Pratama" value=""/></div><div class="field"><label class="field__label" for="cs-email">Alamat email *</label><input id="cs-email" class="field__